        "nl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "6ba418b1-43ed-3c42-8eff-900a21ab25a4",
                "word": "socialisme",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d5187abc-9c2d-3783-a068-206d00964113",
                        "entry_id": "6ba418b1-43ed-3c42-8eff-900a21ab25a4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "maatschappijvorm gebaseerd op gelijkheid, sociale rechtvaardigheid en solidariteit, in principe uitgaande van een vrije markt maar waarbij het collectief, al dan niet belichaamd door de overheid/staat, de hoogste beslissingsbevoegdheid heeft over de verdeling van macht en goederen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "96918359-0d0f-4643-b8df-bb2cbded3963",
                        "source_entry_id": "6ba418b1-43ed-3c42-8eff-900a21ab25a4",
                        "source_sense_id": "d5187abc-9c2d-3783-a068-206d00964113",
                        "target_lang_word": "Sozialismus",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Sozialismus",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d53b8563-3544-3942-9030-ae567dc4ea3f",
                                        "entry_id": "6f92ca02-84c7-3184-9ab0-7800e286ea9b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ein Konzept der Gesellschaft (in Konkurrenz zu Kapitalismus und Liberalismus und als Vorstufe zum Kommunismus), das auf die Vergesellschaftung der Produktionsmittel und eine gerechte Verteilung der Güter abzielt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b594e539-e255-4675-b833-c629444034de",
                                                "sense_id": "d53b8563-3544-3942-9030-ae567dc4ea3f",
                                                "text": "Fidel Castro gab in der Rede wiederholt die Losung \"Sozialismus oder Tod\" ab."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19904670-a021-49b3-a505-6f42e413f379",
                                                "sense_id": "d53b8563-3544-3942-9030-ae567dc4ea3f",
                                                "text": "„Der Witz vermittelt somit nicht die Erkenntnis, dass es eine Alternative zwischen beiden Wirtschaftsformen gibt, sondern dass die eine, der Sozialismus, indiskutabel ist, die andere, der Kapitalismus, aber kritisiert werden muss.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "befb4d54-1742-4a7b-896c-5215e71286ec",
                                                "sense_id": "d53b8563-3544-3942-9030-ae567dc4ea3f",
                                                "text": "„Die Deutschland hat gar nichts mit Sozialismus zu tun.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "28760e1f-2057-32de-b896-89b01ed8e8c8",
                                        "entry_id": "6f92ca02-84c7-3184-9ab0-7800e286ea9b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "eine Politik, die ideologisch eine Gesellschaft schafft und alles dieser Gesellschaft unterordnet"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ef7ab15-695c-4985-9154-4cec6ebe5e6b",
                                                "sense_id": "28760e1f-2057-32de-b896-89b01ed8e8c8",
                                                "text": "„Er wird auf Befehl des Staates aufgebaut wie zuvor der Sozialismus und funktioniert von oben nach unten.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "99131d78-771a-4cf8-9d2b-7b286ebff097",
                        "source_entry_id": "6ba418b1-43ed-3c42-8eff-900a21ab25a4",
                        "source_sense_id": "d5187abc-9c2d-3783-a068-206d00964113",
                        "target_lang_word": "socialism",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "socialism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b558e9ae-ba36-34ed-8a87-90542c22fd03",
                                        "entry_id": "12f646fd-4cdb-3a54-8f09-bff69f54e703",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of various economic and political theories advocating collective or governmental ownership and administration of the means of production and distribution of goods."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de5162f3-b29e-4154-b8db-e704b8c13867",
                                                "sense_id": "b558e9ae-ba36-34ed-8a87-90542c22fd03",
                                                "text": "Soil improvement often involves the movement of large quantities of earth, but the Chinese peasants face this task with a high degree of enthusiasm for socialism."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a3898759-fdc8-34c7-84c2-e0d6f968c2b7",
                                        "entry_id": "12f646fd-4cdb-3a54-8f09-bff69f54e703",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of various economic and political theories advocating collective or governmental ownership and administration of the means of production and distribution of goods.",
                                            "A system of social and economic equality in which there is no private property."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b30a6100-a93a-402c-9b9e-148140157684",
                                                "sense_id": "a3898759-fdc8-34c7-84c2-e0d6f968c2b7",
                                                "text": "…Americans as a rule have no faith in the fundamental doctrine of socialism — no private property. To be sure, that fundamental doctrine is not expressly maintained in this program of the British Labor Party ; but all its proposals lead straight to the adoption by the nation of that doctrine…"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "42fde2d3-1675-36f7-8ba8-6b85d5def654",
                                        "entry_id": "12f646fd-4cdb-3a54-8f09-bff69f54e703",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of various economic and political theories advocating collective or governmental ownership and administration of the means of production and distribution of goods.",
                                            "A system or condition of society in which the means of production are owned and controlled by the state."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0972e40c-d5f5-4728-9658-b74820b7fe62",
                                                "sense_id": "42fde2d3-1675-36f7-8ba8-6b85d5def654",
                                                "text": "Socialism is usually defined as \"common ownership of the means of production\". Crudely: the State, representing the whole nation, owns everything, and everyone is a State employee. This does not mean that people are stripped of private possessions such as clothes and furniture, but it does mean that all productive goods, such as land, mines, ships and machinery, are the property of the State... One must also add the following: approximate equality of incomes (it need be no more than approximate), political democracy, and abolition of all hereditary privilege, especially in education. These are simply the necessary safeguards against the reappearance of a class-system."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "52e2dee5-c799-43d2-8dd7-ff769ad10140",
                                                "sense_id": "42fde2d3-1675-36f7-8ba8-6b85d5def654",
                                                "text": "As Gorbachev understood perestroika, the Soviet Union would retain the principal components of state socialism (state control over the means of production and centralized planning), meaning that state control over the economy and the labor force were to be maintained."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9321cd49-a4c0-3327-ba2c-59d35dc08a6d",
                                        "entry_id": "12f646fd-4cdb-3a54-8f09-bff69f54e703",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The intermediate phase of social development between capitalism and communism in Marxist theory in which the state has control of the means of production."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c065a1ff-0d64-4d81-807d-c718cafe4e05",
                                                "sense_id": "9321cd49-a4c0-3327-ba2c-59d35dc08a6d",
                                                "text": "For me, socialism is not statism, or the collective ownership of the means of production. It is a judgment on the priorities of economic policy…the community takes precedence over the individual in legitimate economic policy. The first lien on the resources of a society therefore should be to establish that \"social minimum\" which would allow individuals to lead a life of self-respect, to be members of the community."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b2f91546-5fc5-3f6c-a845-f93571bc611f",
                                        "entry_id": "12f646fd-4cdb-3a54-8f09-bff69f54e703",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of a group of later political philosophies such democratic socialism and social democracy which do not envisage the need for full state ownership of the means of production nor transition to full communism, and which are typically based on principles of community decision making, social equality and the avoidance of economic and social exclusion, with economic policy giving first preference to community goals over individual ones."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c9e7f07b-45e3-3960-b75a-8c12be1d4de8",
                                        "entry_id": "12f646fd-4cdb-3a54-8f09-bff69f54e703",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any left-wing ideology, government regulations, or policies promoting a welfare state, nationalisation, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "often",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5081667-474d-4c66-8867-0515f8b2e89a",
                                                "sense_id": "c9e7f07b-45e3-3960-b75a-8c12be1d4de8",
                                                "text": "I have used the term \"liberal solidarity\". It needs to stake out its ideological territory and to debate not only with socialism and conservatism, but with other varieties of liberalism."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "21409658-21dd-48d8-89d9-aa14395b4cbc",
                        "source_entry_id": "6ba418b1-43ed-3c42-8eff-900a21ab25a4",
                        "source_sense_id": "d5187abc-9c2d-3783-a068-206d00964113",
                        "target_lang_word": "socialisme",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "socialisme",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2c230888-27de-3ab9-a12a-d9dccf6c4d6b",
                                        "entry_id": "69eb064d-ccc3-3806-9621-a2106a1b0db0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Doctrine qui préconise une socialisation sociale et économique, condamnant les inégalités sociales et la propriété privée des moyens de production. Les courants du socialisme sont très divers, certains souhaitant s’appuyer sur l’État, d’autres souhaitant son abolition (ou sa dissolution)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94b0422a-a44f-4258-ba66-34ab07fa1a90",
                                                "sense_id": "2c230888-27de-3ab9-a12a-d9dccf6c4d6b",
                                                "text": "Si le socialisme est autoritaire, si des gouvernements disposent de la puissance économique, comme, à présent, de la puissance politique, si, en un mot, nous devons subir la tyrannie industrielle, alors le nouvel état de l’homme sera pire que le précédent."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c652b76b-5d75-407b-bc04-117302033e54",
                                                "sense_id": "2c230888-27de-3ab9-a12a-d9dccf6c4d6b",
                                                "text": "Le syndicalisme se trouve engagé, en France, dans une propagande antimilitariste qui montre clairement l’immense distance qui le sépare du socialisme parlementaire sur cette question de l’État."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f1f9b3a-f6d6-44fd-8c5f-fc7a7c5edc45",
                                                "sense_id": "2c230888-27de-3ab9-a12a-d9dccf6c4d6b",
                                                "text": "Favori de l’esprit impérialiste allemand, il représentait l’idéal du nouveau sentiment aristocratique, – la chevalerie nouvelle, disait-on, – qui régna après que le socialisme, affaibli par ses divisions intestines et son manque de discipline, fut anéanti,et que la richesse se fut concentrée entre les mains de quelques familles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "129b7893-d365-4c95-a74e-5e4847819218",
                                                "sense_id": "2c230888-27de-3ab9-a12a-d9dccf6c4d6b",
                                                "text": "Le socialisme, lui, tend à transformer le néo-malthusianisme en une sorte d’obligation morale très précise."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5c0ec36-58d9-4d42-891d-0e15314b4300",
                                                "sense_id": "2c230888-27de-3ab9-a12a-d9dccf6c4d6b",
                                                "text": "Le « socialisme arabe» aura été l'expression de la montée des petites bourgeoisies capables de nationaliser tant bien que mal les hauteurs dominantes de l’économie (banque, commerce extérieur, industries), de procéder à une réforme agraire relative […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae0d38b3-e776-4140-b27c-71169ab022c3",
                                                "sense_id": "2c230888-27de-3ab9-a12a-d9dccf6c4d6b",
                                                "text": "[…] Je ne crois pas qu’autre chimère ait jamais été poursuivie avec autant\nd’ardeur par l’esprit humain, sauf peut-être la pierre philosophale ou la preuve de\nl’existence de Dieu, ni qu’une autre utopie ait fait couler autant d’encre, sauf peut-être\nle socialisme."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "12e1d320-2bfc-4ccd-b394-2ce112092dea",
                                                "sense_id": "2c230888-27de-3ab9-a12a-d9dccf6c4d6b",
                                                "text": "Pour beaucoup de gens, le socialisme se résume aux goulags sibériens, aux purges staliniennes et à la propagande d’État. C’est une espèce de croquemitaine dont on menace les égarés pris d’un penchant suspect pour l’égalité de fait."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d57af0b4-2d52-4bf7-8ba8-19e9954e4e2e",
                                                "sense_id": "2c230888-27de-3ab9-a12a-d9dccf6c4d6b",
                                                "text": "C’est de la situation des prolétaires qu’est née la question de propriété qui se traite partout aujourd’hui ; question qui se résoudrait par le combat et la partage si elle n’état résolue bientôt par la raison, la politique et la charité sociale. La charité, c’est le socialisme ; – l’égoïsme, c’est individualisme."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4cf8930c-f63d-395b-86d8-0d5c907711b9",
                                        "entry_id": "69eb064d-ccc3-3806-9621-a2106a1b0db0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dans la théorie de Karl Marx et de Friedrich Engels, phase de transition entre la dictature du prolétariat et le communisme intégral définie comme une dissolution de l’État et des classes sociales."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Marxism",
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d6739b63-0fc8-4952-ad6f-bfe31cdce6d7",
                                                "sense_id": "4cf8930c-f63d-395b-86d8-0d5c907711b9",
                                                "text": "Mais la différence scientifique entre socialisme et communisme est claire. Ce qu'on appelle communément socialisme, Marx l'a appelé la \"première\" phase ou phase inférieure de la société communiste. Dans la mesure où les moyens de production deviennent propriété commune, le mot \"communiste\" peut s'appliquer également ici, à condition de ne pas oublier que ce n'est pas le communisme intégral."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
